  "problem": "Baseline CMS catalog entries exposed titles without evidence-backed distribution/resource candidates, collapsed temporal/modified/format roles, and could treat missing dictionary locators as dictionary-absent or HTTP 200 documentation as payload success.",
  "resulting_behavior": "bindCmsCatalogResources binds captured dataset identifiers, resourcesAPI links and distribution objects from a retained CMS catalog fixture. Title, temporal, modified and format stay in distinct roles. A cost-report fixture distinguishes product-level coverage 2011-2023 from the 2023 distribution and 2026-01-08 metadata modification. API/CSV/XLSX/ZIP and landing-page locators keep catalog pointers. Duplicate locators deduplicate by capture identity. buildCmsCauseLedger emits one reconciled row for all 159 CMS IDs. Missing dictionary locators remain unresolved, never dictionary-absent. HTTP 200 HTML cannot be JSON payload success. Live fetch is forbidden in tests. The historical cms-documents CLI remains gated behind isCli and is not invoked by tests.",
